@coreMosUrl = https://pre-core.mos.oict.cz/services/MOSservice.asmx
@serviceKey = c8b76d63-3c39-46f2-ac12-887776070d45
@userName = doplnit@example.com
@password = doplnit-heslo
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@customerId = 0

### Co tento soubor testuje
# BE volani z logu:
# - POST https://localhost:7261/v1/client/photo
# - multipart/form-data: PhotoColor=barevna.png, PhotoBW=cernobila.png
# - BE skoncilo na kroku UpdatePhoto.
#
# Prime MOS volani dela totéz bez BE PidLitacka:
# 1. AuthenticateLogin - ziska SessionID pro MOS.
# 2. GetCustomers - najde CustomerID prihlaseneho uzivatele; vyber self customer, obvykle CustomerRelationType = 1.
# 3. UpdatePhoto - posle barevnou a cernobilou fotku primo do Core MOS.
# 4. UpdatePhotoWebP - odpovida navazujicimu kroku BE, pokud je dodana PhotoBW.
# 5. GetPhoto - kontrolni nacteni ulozenych fotek.
#
# Pred spustenim:
# - dopln @userName a @password, nebo rovnou dopln platne @sessionId z Redis/Klikatka.
# - po GetCustomers zkopiruj CustomerID do @customerId.
# - pokud chces reprodukovat jen pad BE kroku, spust AuthenticateLogin/GetCustomers/UpdatePhoto.
#
# Zdrojove soubory pouzite pro Base64:
# - C:\Users\OP3782\Downloads\barevna.png (853147 B)
# - C:\Users\OP3782\Downloads\cernobila.png (727580 B)

### Core MOS - AuthenticateLogin
# Z odpovedi zkopiruj AuthenticateLoginResult / Session / SessionID do @sessionId.
POST {{coreMosUrl}}
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "globdata/AuthenticateLogin"

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
               xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
               xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <AuthenticateLogin xmlns="globdata">
      <ServiceKey>{{serviceKey}}</ServiceKey>
      <UserName>{{userName}}</UserName>
      <Password>{{password}}</Password>
    </AuthenticateLogin>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Core MOS - GetCustomers
# Z odpovedi vyber self customer a zkopiruj CustomerID do @customerId.
# BE pouziva GetCustomers a hleda zakaznika s CustomerRelationType = self.
POST {{coreMosUrl}}
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "globdata/GetCustomers"

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
               xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
               xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <GetCustomers xmlns="globdata">
      <ServiceKey>{{serviceKey}}</ServiceKey>
      <SessionID>{{sessionId}}</SessionID>
    </GetCustomers>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Core MOS - GetCustomerInfo pred zmenou fotky
# Volitelne: overi, ze @customerId ukazuje na spravneho klienta a ukaze stavajici PhotoStatus* metadata.
POST {{coreMosUrl}}
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "globdata/GetCustomerInfo"

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
               xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
               xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <GetCustomerInfo xmlns="globdata">
      <ServiceKey>{{serviceKey}}</ServiceKey>
      <SessionID>{{sessionId}}</SessionID>
      <CustomerID>{{customerId}}</CustomerID>
    </GetCustomerInfo>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Core MOS - UpdatePhoto
# Prime MOS volani odpovidajici BE kroku UpdatePhoto.
# Ocekavany uspech: UpdatePhotoResult / ID = 0, Type/Text typicky OK.
# Pokud vrati chybu, je problem reprodukovany primo na Core MOS vrstve nebo v datech fotek.
POST {{coreMosUrl}}
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "globdata/UpdatePhoto"

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
               xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
               xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <UpdatePhoto xmlns="globdata">
      <ServiceKey>{{serviceKey}}</ServiceKey>
      <SessionID>{{sessionId}}</SessionID>
      <CustomerID>{{customerId}}</CustomerID>
      <PhotoColor></PhotoColor>
      <PhotoBW></PhotoBW>
    </UpdatePhoto>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Core MOS - UpdatePhotoWebP
# BE tento krok vola az po uspesnem UpdatePhoto, pokud byla dodana cernobila fotka.
# Ocekavany uspech podle BE: vysledek >= 0. Pokud chces izolovat puvodni chybu, tento krok zatim nespoustej.
POST {{coreMosUrl}}
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "globdata/UpdatePhotoWebP"

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
               xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
               xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <UpdatePhotoWebP xmlns="globdata">
      <ServiceKey>{{serviceKey}}</ServiceKey>
      <SessionID>{{sessionId}}</SessionID>
      <CustomerID>{{customerId}}</CustomerID>
    </UpdatePhotoWebP>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Core MOS - GetPhoto po zmene
# Kontrolni nacteni fotek primo z MOS. Pozor, odpoved muze byt velka, protoze obsahuje Base64 obrazky.
POST {{coreMosUrl}}
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "globdata/GetPhoto"

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
               xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
               xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <GetPhoto xmlns="globdata">
      <ServiceKey>{{serviceKey}}</ServiceKey>
      <SessionID>{{sessionId}}</SessionID>
      <CustomerID>{{customerId}}</CustomerID>
    </GetPhoto>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>